<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PRINT/LAB — 3D Printwinkel</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<script src="https://identity.netlify.com/v1/netlify-identity-widget.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="grid-bg"></div>
<header>
<div class="logo"><span class="bracket">[</span>PRINT<span style="color:var(--orange)">/</span>LAB<span class="bracket">]</span><span class="jp">3D prints &nbsp;•&nbsp; handgemaakt</span></div>
<button class="cart-btn" id="cartToggle">
Winkelwagen <span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span>
</button>
</header>

{{ content | safe }}

<section class="about-section">
  <div class="about-content">
    <img src="https://placehold.co/150x150/12161f/ff5a1f?text=Anime+Avatar" alt="Avatar van de maker" class="about-avatar">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h3>Over de Maker</h3>
      <p>Hoi! Ik ben de maker achter PRINT/LAB. Ik ben 10 jaar oud en helemaal gek op 3D-printen en ontwerpen. Elk item dat je hier ziet, print ik persoonlijk op mijn eigen 3D-printer in mijn kamer. Bedankt voor je support!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Product Quick View Modal -->
<div class="pm-overlay" id="pmOverlay"></div>
<div class="pm-modal" id="productModal">
  <button class="pm-close" id="closeProductModal">&times;</button>
  
  <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
      <button id="pmPrev" style="position:absolute; left:10px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); z-index:2; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color:white; border:none; padding:10px 15px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1.2rem; border-radius:4px; display:none;">&#10094;</button>
      <img id="pmImage" class="pm-image" src="" alt="Product">
      <button id="pmNext" style="position:absolute; right:10px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); z-index:2; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color:white; border:none; padding:10px 15px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1.2rem; border-radius:4px; display:none;">&#10095;</button>
  </div>
  <div id="pmDots" style="text-align:center; margin-top:-10px; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:5px;"></div>

  <h2 id="pmTitle" class="pm-title"></h2>
  <p id="pmDesc" class="pm-desc"></p>
  <div id="pmPrice" class="pm-price"></div>
</div>

<div class="overlay" id="overlay"></div>
<aside class="drawer" id="drawer">
<div class="drawer-head">
<h2>Je winkelwagen</h2>
<button class="close-btn" id="closeDrawer" aria-label="Sluiten">&times;</button>
</div>
<div class="drawer-items" id="drawerItems"></div>
<div class="drawer-foot" id="drawerFoot">
<div class="total-row" style="align-items:flex-end;">
  <span>Totaal</span>
  <div style="text-align:right;" id="totalAmount">€ 0,00</div>
</div>
<button class="checkout-btn" id="checkoutBtn" disabled>Bestellen</button>
</div>
<!-- Real Netlify-detectable form (static copy for the build bot) -->
<form name="bestelling" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" hidden>
<input type="text" name="naam" />
<input type="email" name="email" />
<input type="tel" name="telefoon" />
<input type="radio" name="levering" value="Ophalen" />
<input type="radio" name="levering" value="Verzenden" />
<input type="text" name="adres" />
<input type="radio" name="betaling" value="Tikkie" />
<input type="radio" name="betaling" value="Contant" />
<input type="text" name="cart_data" />
<input type="text" name="bot-field" />
</form>
<form class="checkout-form" id="checkoutForm" name="bestelling" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
<input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="bestelling" />
<p class="honeypot"><label>Laat dit leeg: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
<div>
<span class="field-label">Naam</span>
<input type="text" name="naam" required>
</div>
<div>
<span class="field-label">E-mail</span>
<input type="email" name="email" required>
</div>
<div>
<span class="field-label">Telefoonnummer</span>
<input type="tel" name="telefoon" required>
</div>

<div>
<span class="field-label">Leveringsmethode</span>
<div class="radio-group">
<label><input type="radio" name="levering" value="Ophalen" required> Ophalen</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="levering" value="Verzenden" required> Verzenden (PostNL)</label>
</div>
</div>

<div id="addressField" style="display:none;">
<span class="field-label">Bezorgadres</span>
<textarea name="adres" id="adresInput" rows="3" style="width:100%; background:#0b0e14; border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink); padding:9px 10px; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.9rem; border-radius:2px;"></textarea>
</div>

<p class="privacy-note" style="margin-top:0;">
  <strong>Verzendkosten:</strong> € 6,50 (Gratis verzending boven de € 50)<br>
  We gebruiken deze gegevens alleen voor je bestelling.
</p>

<div>
<span class="field-label">Betaalmethode</span>
<div class="radio-group">
<label><input type="radio" name="betaling" value="Tikkie" required> Tikkie</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="betaling" value="Contant" required> Contant (bij ophalen)</label>
</div>
</div>
<input type="hidden" name="cart_data" id="cartDataField">
<button type="submit" class="submit-order">Bestelling versturen</button>
</form>
<div class="success-msg" id="successMsg">
✓ Bedankt voor je bestelling!<br>We nemen snel contact met je op.
</div>
</aside>
<footer>
<span>© PRINT/LAB</span>
</footer>

<script src="/js/app.js"></script>
<script>
  if (window.netlifyIdentity) {
    window.netlifyIdentity.on("init", user => {
      if (!user) {
        window.netlifyIdentity.on("login", () => {
          document.location.href = "/admin/";
        });
      }
    });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
